                                🌾 ESP32 AND DEVICES CONNECTION LIST
========================================================================================================================
Firmware Version : v4.1 Production Pinout (Safe Non-Strapping Pins)
Target Board     : ESP32 Dev Module (30-Pin / 38-Pin)
Main Arduino File: ArduinoTests/AgriShield_Main/AgriShield_Main.ino
Display Type     : 1.3 Inch OLED (SH1106 Driver, Adafruit_SH110X Library, I2C Address 0x3C)
Combo Sensor     : AHT20 + BMP280 4-Pin Module (Temp, Humidity, Pressure - I2C Address 0x38 & 0x76)
Light Sensor     : BH1750 5-Pin Module (VCC, GND, SCL, SDA, ADDR -> GND - I2C Address 0x23)
