4. LEFT SIDE VS RIGHT SIDE PIN WIRING SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

👈 LEFT SIDE PINS (From Top to Bottom):
- D34 (GPIO 34)  --> Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor Analog Output (AO)
- D35 (GPIO 35)  --> Rain Droplet Sensor Analog Output (AO)
- D32 (GPIO 32)  --> 4300mAh Battery Voltage Sensor Signal Output (S)
- D33 (GPIO 33)  --> TP4056 USB Charger STAT/CHRG Signal Input (Pin 7)
- D25 (GPIO 25)  --> Push Switch Page Button (Terminal 1)
- D26 (GPIO 26)  --> Red Alert LED (+) via 220Ω
- D27 (GPIO 27)  --> Yellow Data TX LED (+) via 220Ω
- D14 (GPIO 14)  --> Push Switch Backup Pin (Optional)
- D13 (GPIO 13)  --> Orange Page Switch LED (+) via 220Ω
- GND            --> Common Ground (-)
- VIN (5V)       --> MicroSD Card Module VCC (MUST be 5V!)

👉 RIGHT SIDE PINS (From Top to Bottom):
- D23 (GPIO 23)  --> MicroSD Card Module MOSI (SPI Data Out)
- D22 (GPIO 22)  --> Shared I2C Clock SCL (OLED, AHT20/BMP280, BH1750)
- D21 (GPIO 21)  --> Shared I2C Data SDA (OLED, AHT20/BMP280, BH1750)
- D19 (GPIO 19)  --> MicroSD Card Module MISO (SPI Data In)
- D18 (GPIO 18)  --> MicroSD Card Module SCK (SPI Clock)
- D5  (GPIO 5)   --> MicroSD Card Module CS (Chip Select)
- TX2 (GPIO 17)  --> Blue Bluetooth LED (+) via 220Ω
- RX2 (GPIO 16)  --> Green Wi-Fi LED (+) via 220Ω
- D4  (GPIO 4)   --> White Heartbeat LED (+) via 220Ω
- GND            --> Common Ground (-)
- 3V3            --> 3.3V Power Output (OLED, AHT20/BMP280, BH1750, Soil, Rain)

